{
  "chapter": "durability/latency",
  "tier": "drill",
  "notes": [
    "Deciding where a step runs. A local activity skips the task-queue round trip, which",
    "is worth engineering on the entry path and worth nothing anywhere else.",
    "Four things disqualify a step, checked in a fixed order: it is a model call, it needs",
    "to heartbeat, it must stay reachable by a signal while it runs, or it runs longer",
    "than the workflow task window (80% of the ten-second default).",
    "The fifth is not a disqualification but a decision: a step off the entry path is left",
    "unoptimized on purpose, because there is a model call ahead of it to hide in.",
    "entryLatencyMs counts only the entry path, and only the round trips still being paid."
  ],
  "config": { "localBudgetMs": 8000, "roundTripMs": 120 },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "validation-on-the-entry-path-runs-local",
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "validate_inbound",
          "kind": "validation",
          "durationMs": 4,
          "onEntryPath": true,
          "needsSignals": false,
          "needsHeartbeat": false
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "placements": [
          { "name": "validate_inbound", "mode": "local", "reason": "short_and_on_the_entry_path" }
        ],
        "entryLatencyMs": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-model-call-is-never-local",
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "summarize",
          "kind": "model",
          "durationMs": 50,
          "onEntryPath": true,
          "needsSignals": false,
          "needsHeartbeat": false
        }
      ],
      "result": {
        "placements": [{ "name": "summarize", "mode": "activity", "reason": "model_call" }],
        "entryLatencyMs": 170
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-step-that-heartbeats-is-never-local",
